descriptions.PhysicsServer2D/method/area_get_canvas_i:
Returns the ObjectID of the canvas attached to the area. Use
@GlobalScope.instance_from_id to retrieve a CanvasLayer from a nonzero
ObjectID.

descriptions.PhysicsServer2D/method/area_get_object_i:
Returns the ObjectID attached to the area. Use
@GlobalScope.instance_from_id to retrieve an Object from a nonzero
ObjectID.

descriptions.PhysicsServer2D/method/body_get_canvas_i:
Returns the ObjectID of the canvas attached to the body. Use
@GlobalScope.instance_from_id to retrieve a CanvasLayer from a nonzero
ObjectID.

descriptions.PhysicsServer2D/method/body_get_object_i:
Returns the ObjectID attached to the body. Use
@GlobalScope.instance_from_id to retrieve an Object from a nonzero
ObjectID.

descriptions.SteamLeaderboards/method/find:
Looks up an existing leaderboard by its Steam API name. On success, the
typed result contains a SteamLeaderboard. An unknown board returns
@GlobalScope.ERR_DOES_NOT_EXIST.

descriptions.SteamPresence/method/clear_joinable:
Clears this Game's connect key and suppresses automatic publication for
the current hosted lobby. Keeps the status label, party grouping, and
any foreign connect key. Call joinable to publish again. A newly hosted
lobby uses its usual visibility policy. Returns
@GlobalScope.ERR_UNAVAILABLE outside a live Steam Game scope, or
@GlobalScope.FAILED if Steam...

descriptions.SteamPresence/method/joinable:
Publishes Steam Join Game for the exact Game's current friends-only or
public lobby while admission is open and seats remain. Returns
@GlobalScope.OK if Steam accepted the route or the Game already owns it.
Returns @GlobalScope.ERR_BUSY when a foreign connect key exists,
@GlobalScope.ERR_UNAUTHORIZED for an ineligible or stale lobby, and...

descriptions.String/method/find:
Returns the index of the first occurrence of what in this string, or -1
if there are none. The search's start can be specified with from,
continuing to the end of the string.

descriptions.StringName/method/find:
